{"id": "0755a560cd6391ab6e41419598bf3b44", "text": "\u2018lakshana \u2019. Arjuna , by using  the term \u2018samadhi \u2019 (state  of complete  mental  \nconcentration  on the Lord),  has himself  defined  a characteristic  (lakshana ) \nof a person  with deep  conviction  in divine  knowledge.  By using  the word  \n\u2018bhasha \u2019, Arjuna  is enquiring  about  the characteristic  of such a person  \nwhen  that person  is out of samadhi  and is engaged  in normal  day to day \nactivities.  References  to talking,  sittin g, walking  etc., in this verse  here", "embedding": [0.03043052740395069, 0.015735017135739326, -0.01722000166773796, 0.019195036962628365, -0.03345632180571556, 0.023914726451039314, 0.19422036409378052, -0.02086091786623001, -0.020343191921710968, 0.003458629595115781, 0.019575776532292366, -0.027553681284189224, 0.00952083244919777, -0.08987078070640564, 0.042415786534547806, 0.038344450294971466, 0.004909588024020195, 0.04144500941038132, -0.036401960998773575, -0.045673567801713943, 0.0037355858366936445, 0.07176270335912704, -0.024459701031446457, 0.06733555346727371, -0.020640619099140167, -0.005037354771047831, 0.034827884286642075, -0.12033345550298691, 0.014564301818609238, -0.015791544690728188, 0.03256438300013542, 0.0009508072398602962, 0.006945720873773098, 0.01142749935388565, -0.10587506741285324, 0.12021356076002121, -0.05471497401595116, 0.09935154765844345, -0.026607703417539597, -0.08206697553396225, 0.024407988414168358, 0.03324649855494499, -0.00013789582590106875, -0.05213813856244087, 0.02275196462869644, -0.06542105972766876, -0.10416045039892197, -0.007559591438621283, 0.004760650917887688, -0.03740920498967171, -0.05267223343253136, -0.051684290170669556, -0.07248266041278839, 0.08193261921405792, 0.018658068031072617, 0.002654044656082988, -0.019773192703723907, 0.01441342756152153, 0.05392637476325035, 0.06956110149621964, -0.0027085114270448685, 0.029906759038567543, 0.11218900978565216, -0.050853412598371506, 0.